Retest on RW-QA with 9.2.0.3 is done: TC-017 now gives EUR 584.90 and TC-033 =
shows CO2 on all legs. I also re-ran the other 38 cases as a regression, all =
40 passed. For the rollback I propose: full database snapshot by RouteWise on=
 Friday 23 Oct at 18:00 after the freeze, decision point Saturday 24 Oct at 2=
2:00 after smoke tests, and if no-go we restore the snapshot, which takes abo=
ut 3 hours. The booking bot is paused during the window and I restart it manu=
ally.

Best regards,
Pieter Bakker
